{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2022-01", "window": 4, "start_date": 1642982400, "end_date": 1643673599, "month_true_total": 89, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:49:59 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "109165122", "author": {"steamid": "76561198114559479", "personaname": "Hergatalervian H. Smoog", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RandallThymes/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 74, "playtime_forever": 1320, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 183, "last_played": 1723866954, "avatar": "48aaf6415bff6fabe0bde8a6fc57ef2f19fca349"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun, normally fast-paced shooters like Dusk make me motion sick, but this game doesn't. Guns feel punchy and unique, the upgrade system isn't too complex, it just adds a bit of extra progression to make future runs easier (my first run still made it to the third boss before my luck ran out). I highly recommend this game, especially if you find it on sale", "timestamp_created": 1643616685, "timestamp_updated": 1643616685, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109154998", "author": {"steamid": "76561198085449523", "personaname": "lean", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kleanv/", "num_games_owned": 156, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1202, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 107, "last_played": 1698726856, "avatar": "9879f27d965a915e73bbc15a9ba5afbecb65f6ae"}, "language": "english", "review": "good shooter\nmeh roguelite", "timestamp_created": 1643600971, "timestamp_updated": 1643600971, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109138347", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070758816", "personaname": "Turnip", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198070758816/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 5532, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2444, "last_played": 1771730824, "avatar": "15b766afa04f2bf3c8cf92a029eca5e9123c3ef7"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's not even out yet and it's honestly one of favorite games of all  time. Movement is crisp and satifying, guns feel great, if you want a game you can just exist in a feel like a badass, this is perfect. Like PvE Quake with a better soundtrack.", "timestamp_created": 1643579201, "timestamp_updated": 1643579201, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.518518567085266113", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109137813", "author": {"steamid": "76561198316230973", "personaname": "scottxc461", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198316230973/", "num_games_owned": 444, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3430, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 250, "last_played": 1774744784, "avatar": "ccd231e70a119a3bf08fd4223e257d3a0a47807d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Did you like the gunplay in Borderlands 3 but thought the story was ♥♥♥♥? Did you love Doom Eternal but could use a break from guts, gore and just a generally metal atmosphere? Then do I have the game for you, Roboquest is these two games rolled into one mechanically but with its own charming art style and personality. The guns are punchy, varied and appeal to multiple play styles. The story is basic but you don't really need it in this game, in fact if you're a post borderlands 3 player like myself it'll come as a godsend. Be prepared to destroy hordes of robot enemies while bumping to a lighthearted, excellent EDM soundtrack. Don't get it twisted though, Roboquest is not an easy game by any means and youll be pushed to sprint, jump and make quick decisions to just survive. The Devs are constantly updating content and are invested in the community.", "timestamp_created": 1643578624, "timestamp_updated": 1643578624, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "109077472", "author": {"steamid": "76561198374025845", "personaname": "JACOBMACK", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fvhgvhbjhbvh/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 674, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 217, "last_played": 1725747656, "avatar": "bc10be6a669ed681ed521a250c31316affc14156"}, "language": "english", "review": "I Love This Game", "timestamp_created": 1643519169, "timestamp_updated": 1643519169, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}